Dialogue: 50,0:01:58.93,0:02:02.73,Narrator-207-,,0,0,0,,{The long battle of\N400 years had ended, - OG}Four hundred years of fighting\Nhad come to an end at last,{Gord, Viz}
Dialogue: 50,0:02:02.73,0:02:07.27,Narrator-207-,,0,0,0,,{and all the citizens of Skypiea continued their joyous party day after day. - OG}and the Skypieans continued\Ntheir celebration for days on end.{WF}
Dialogue: 50,0:02:08.78,0:02:12.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I... I... I can't drink any more...
Dialogue: 50,0:02:17.03,0:02:18.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There they are!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:24.00,0:02:24.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:27.25,0:02:28.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:28.54,0:02:30.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Nami, wake everyone up!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:31.67,0:02:32.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:34.93,0:02:36.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We're gonna steal the gold and run!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:39.14,0:02:40.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There's gold?!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:40.47,0:02:42.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{Idiot! Not so loud! - OG}Dummy! Keep it down!{Gord+WF}
Dialogue: 50,0:02:42.06,0:02:45.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{What do you mean "idiot"?!\NYou're louder than I am! - OG}What do you mean "dummy"?!\NYou're louder than I am!{Gord}
Dialogue: 50,0:02:45.73,0:02:48.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{Hey! I'm louder, you say?! You're the louder one! - OG}Louder than {\i1}you{\i0}?!\NYou're the loud one!{Gord/Polly}
Dialogue: 50,0:02:48.98,0:02:54.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{What?! You're calling me loud\Nwhen you're really super loud?! - OG}What?! You're calling {\i1}me{\i0} loud\Nwhen you're being super-duper loud?!{PP}
Dialogue: 50,0:02:54.59,0:02:58.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{Your voice is the one that's\Nreally super-mega-ultra loud! - OG}It's {\i1}your{\i0} voice that's\Nsuper-mega-ultra loud!{Gord, CPS}
Dialogue: 50,0:02:58.07,0:03:02.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{There's no way that's true! I'm\Ntalking loud because you're loud! - OG}No way! The only reason I'm talking\Nso loud is because you're yelling!{Gord+Naoto+Polly}
Dialogue: 50,0:03:02.75,0:03:05.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{You're the one who spoke loud first! - OG}You were yelling first!{Naoto}
Dialogue: 50,0:03:02.75,0:03:05.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Shut up! I can't sleep!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:05.92,0:03:07.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{What?! You're the loud one! - OG}So what?! You're still the loud one!{Gord}
Dialogue: 50,0:03:07.58,0:03:09.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{It wasn't me! It was you! - OG}Not me! It's you!{Gord}
Dialogue: 50,0:03:09.17,0:03:13.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{I'm a delicate woman! I wouldn't yell\Nwith my mouth wide open, would I?! - OG}I'm a delicate lady! I wouldn't yell\Nwith my mouth wide open, would I?!{Polly}
Dialogue: 50,0:03:13.59,0:03:16.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,See? See?! Your mouth is wide open!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:16.80,0:03:19.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's because you ticked me off!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:19.35,0:03:22.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{[/q2]Like I said, you don't have to shout, you know! - OG}{\q2}I just said you don't have to yell!{Gord+Naoto}
Dialogue: 50,0:03:17.64,0:03:19.80,Secondary-207-,,0,0,0,,Nami{-san}! Good morning!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:19.80,0:03:22.22,Secondary-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh? It's not morning yet!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:08.08,0:03:10.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Usopp hit me!{-viz, this note was here already}
Dialogue: 50,0:03:10.46,0:03:11.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}What?!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:11.38,0:03:13.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{[/an8/q2]There's no way I'd do something like that! - OG}{\an8\q2}I'd never do that!{PP}
Dialogue: 50,0:03:13.59,0:03:15.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{[/an8][untranslated?] - OG}{\an8}Don't accuse me of that!{PP}
Dialogue: 50,0:03:15.68,0:03:17.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{[/an8]But you did hit me here! - OG}{\an8}But you {\i1}did{\i0} hit me!{Naoto}
Dialogue: 50,0:03:17.51,0:03:19.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{Here! It's really true! - OG}{\an8}Right here, I felt it!{Gord}
Dialogue: 50,0:03:19.10,0:03:21.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{[/an8]Yeah, yeah... Go ahead and\Nbe feeble-minded like that. - OG}{\an8}Yeah, yeah... Keep telling\Nyourself that, dummy.{Gord}
Dialogue: 50,0:03:21.47,0:03:23.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{[/an8]What do you mean, "feeble-minded"?! - OG}{\an8}What do you mean, "dummy"?!{Gord}
Dialogue: 50,0:03:14.67,0:03:16.80,Secondary-207-,,0,0,0,,Geez, wake up, sleepyhead!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:22.60,0:03:25.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Blue Sea people sure like\Nto party, don't they?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:25.98,0:03:28.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This is the fourth day in a row.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:28.10,0:03:30.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{Their vitality isn't normal. - OG}Their stamina is incredible.{Gord}
Dialogue: 50,0:03:37.45,0:03:38.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So, that's the plan.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:38.99,0:03:42.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Okay, guys! It's not often that\Nwe get to visit a sky island!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:42.45,0:03:44.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{Make it so that you'll have no regrets! - OG}Make sure you don't\Nleave with any regrets!{Gord, Viz}
Dialogue: 50,0:03:49.08,0:03:51.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Chief! We found the golden bell!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:52.42,0:03:53.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:53.88,0:03:55.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, are you serious?!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:55.38,0:03:59.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah. It's stuck on\Nthe fallen Giant Jack.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:59.34,0:04:01.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We're pulling it out right now.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:02.64,0:04:04.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{Those who can help, come to the western seashore! - OG}If you can help,\Ncome to the western shore!{Gord+Polly, CPS}
Dialogue: 50,0:04:04.93,0:04:07.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{Hurry! Hurry up! - OG}Hurry! Get a move on!{Polly}
Dialogue: 50,0:04:07.48,0:04:10.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{Okay, guys! Gather everyone! - OG}Alright! Gather everyone!{Z}
Dialogue: 50,0:04:10.86,0:04:12.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{The belfry was found! - OG}They found the bell!{Polly+Z}
Dialogue: 50,0:04:12.27,0:04:13.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Where?!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:13.32,0:04:14.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{At the western seashore. - OG}At the western shore.{Gord, CPS}
Dialogue: 50,0:04:14.53,0:04:15.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{Okay! - OG}– Okay!\N– Okay!{Z}
Dialogue: 50,0:04:15.57,0:04:16.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Are you sure?!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:16.28,0:04:18.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{Yeah! Hurry! - OG}Yeah! Hurry up already!{Polly}
Dialogue: 50,0:04:18.53,0:04:20.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{They said they found the bell that fell in the sea! - OG}Apparently it fell into the sea!{WF}
Dialogue: 50,0:04:20.53,0:04:24.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{Yeah. Those who can move, gather at the western seashore! - OG}Yeah. Those who can move,\Ngather at the western shore!{Polly}
Dialogue: 50,0:04:27.00,0:04:28.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{The belfry was found! - OG}They found the bell!{Polly+Z}
Dialogue: 50,0:04:28.96,0:04:30.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{It's at the western seashore! - OG}It's at the western shore!{Gord, to match others}
Dialogue: 50,0:04:31.63,0:04:32.84,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,{The belfry was? - OG}The bell...?{Gord+Z}
Dialogue: 50,0:04:34.63,0:04:36.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,One more time!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:36.13,0:04:38.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,One, two...!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:40.01,0:04:42.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Pull!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:00.53,0:05:03.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{Dammit! We still need more people. - OG}Dammit! We still don't\Nhave enough people.{Naoto}
Dialogue: 50,0:05:06.49,0:05:09.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{It's the pride of our ancestors' city, Shandia. - OG}This is the pride of\Nour ancestors—of Shandora.{Z}
Dialogue: 50,0:05:09.00,0:05:10.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{We'll get it at any cost! - OG}We'll do whatever it takes!{PP}
Dialogue: 50,0:05:10.96,0:05:12.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:12.08,0:05:13.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{Give it everything you got! - OG}Give it all you got!{Gord, CPS}
Dialogue: 50,0:05:13.71,0:05:17.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,One more time! One, two...!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:43.03,0:05:45.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{Pull harder! - OG}Pull with all your might!{Gord, just want a better conclusive line here}
Dialogue: 50,0:05:53.17,0:05:55.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{Rubber band?! So you\Ncall this a rubber band?! - OG}Rubber band?! This is\Ncalled a rubber band?!{Naoto}
Dialogue: 50,0:05:55.75,0:05:56.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:56.71,0:06:01.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{My Usopp Rubber Band did 90% of\Nthe work of taking Giant Jack down! - OG}{\q2}Usopp's Rubber Bands of Doom did\N90 percent of the damage to Giant Jack!{Gord+Z+PP+PJ}
Dialogue: 50,0:06:01.55,0:06:03.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,– Whoa!\N– Whoa! Incredible!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:03.72,0:06:05.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{I'm the only one in the\Nworld that has them. - OG}And I'm the only one\Nin the world who has them.{Gord}
Dialogue: 50,0:06:05.93,0:06:07.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,– Whoa!\N– Whoa! Amazing!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:10.81,0:06:15.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{But... put that aside for now. I'd\Nlike to show you this iron sheet! - OG}But... let's put that aside for now.\NNext up is this iron sheet!{Gord+Spicy+WF}
Dialogue: 50,0:06:15.98,0:06:20.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now, ladies and gentlemen!\NThis is no ordinary iron sheet!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:20.07,0:06:26.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{I tore it off from the Going Merry, our\Nship that endured very hard travels - OG}It's an iron sheet taken from our ship,\Nthe {\i1}Going Merry{\i0}, that's survived{Gord+Barry}
Dialogue: 50,0:06:26.45,0:06:29.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{on the Grand Line, as well as Enel's attacks! It's the "King of Iron Sheets"! - OG}{\q2}the Grand Line, as well as Enel's attacks!\NIt's the "King of Iron Sheets"!{WF+Gord}
Dialogue: 50,0:06:30.37,0:06:32.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{How about it?! You\Nguys want iron, right? - OG}How about it?!\NYou guys want iron, right?{Gord}
Dialogue: 50,0:06:32.41,0:06:34.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{Would you trade me dials for this? - OG}Wanna trade me some dials for this?{Gord+Polly}
Dialogue: 50,0:06:34.75,0:06:36.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No! I want this rubber band!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:36.25,0:06:38.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'll trade you for this rubber band!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:38.38,0:06:40.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{I want one, too! Is that okay?! - OG}I want one too! Can I have one?!{Gord+Naoto}
Dialogue: 50,0:06:40.05,0:06:41.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{[/an8]Me, too! - OG}{\an8}Me too!{Naoto}
Dialogue: 50,0:06:40.67,0:06:43.17,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,Whoa... Are they serious?!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:41.26,0:06:42.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{[/an8]Give me one, too! - OG}{\an8}Give me one too!{Naoto}
Dialogue: 50,0:06:42.47,0:06:43.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{[/an8]Me, too! - OG}{\an8}Me too!{Naoto}
Dialogue: 50,0:06:57.73,0:07:00.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Shells! I got shells! Oh, yeah!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:00.48,0:07:05.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Lucky, lucky! I got so lucky!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:01.07,0:07:02.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{You're in a good mood,\Naren't you, Usopp? - OG}You sure are in a good mood, Usopp.{Gord}
Dialogue: 50,0:07:04.28,0:07:05.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{Did the negotiation go well? - OG}Did the trade go well?{Gord, CPS}
Dialogue: 50,0:07:07.57,0:07:09.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hear that?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:09.53,0:07:12.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{I got lots of dials! - OG}I got a ton of dials!{Gord, Viz}
Dialogue: 50,0:07:13.08,0:07:14.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{I press it and... - OG}Just press here, and...{Polly+Z}
Dialogue: 50,0:07:15.08,0:07:16.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{Just like that! - OG}out it comes!{Polly}
Dialogue: 50,0:07:16.92,0:07:18.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Good for you.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:18.17,0:07:19.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Good for me!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:19.29,0:07:22.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{With this many dials, I can\Ndo many different things! - OG}With this many dials,\NI can do all sorts of stuff!{Gord, Viz}
Dialogue: 50,0:07:23.92,0:07:27.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{The Usopp factory'll\Nbe running full steam! - OG}The Usopp Factory will\Nbe running full steam!{Gord+PJ}
Dialogue: 50,0:07:28.64,0:07:32.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{Hey, Zoro, if you make your swords Flavor Swords - OG}{and store the smell of\Nstuff like melons in them, - OG}{\q2}Hey, Zoro! What if I made your swords\Ninto melon-flavored scent swords?{Polly+Gord+Z}
Dialogue: 50,0:07:32.93,0:07:35.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{you can enjoy your everyday training! - OG}That would spice up\Nyour daily training!{Polly}
Dialogue: 50,0:07:35.48,0:07:36.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No thanks.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:36.23,0:07:37.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh...
Dialogue: 50,0:07:37.35,0:07:41.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{Oh, yeah! I can make\NNami's Clima-Tact stronger! - OG}Oh, yeah! I can upgrade\NNami's Climate Baton!{Gord+PJ+Z}
Dialogue: 50,0:07:41.69,0:07:44.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{My slingshot will be incredible, too! - OG}And my slingshot will\Nbe better than ever!{Gord}
Dialogue: 50,0:07:48.74,0:07:51.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So, where are Robin,\NLuffy, and the others?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:51.91,0:07:55.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{Luffy and the others are still\Ninside. Robin went somewhere. - OG}Luffy and the others are still inside.\NRobin went off somewhere.{Gord+PP}
Dialogue: 50,0:08:01.04,0:08:04.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{In any case... this\Nsnake's really conked out. - OG}Well, I'll be... This snake\Nsure is a sound sleeper.{Gord+Z, Viz}
Dialogue: 50,0:08:04.96,0:08:07.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{He kept dancing day after day... - OG}He was dancing for days...{PP+Polly}
Dialogue: 50,0:08:07.43,0:08:10.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{though I don't know what\Nhe was so happy about. - OG}Wonder what he was so happy about.{WF}
Dialogue: 50,0:08:10.05,0:08:12.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{Anyhow, they'd better come out soon, - OG}In any case, they should\Ncome out soon.{Gord+Polly}
Dialogue: 50,0:08:12.01,0:08:14.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{because if he wakes up, he could\Ngive them a hard time again. - OG}He could be trouble if he wakes up.{Gord+Polly, CPS}
Dialogue: 50,0:08:14.31,0:08:15.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:15.31,0:08:17.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{This good-tempered snake? - OG}This sweetheart of a snake?{Gord}
Dialogue: 50,0:08:17.73,0:08:21.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{Idiot! You just don't know\Nhow troublesome he can be! - OG}Idiot! You just don't know\Nwhat a pain he can be!{Gord}
Dialogue: 50,0:08:21.23,0:08:22.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{This good-tempered snake? - OG}This sweetheart of a snake?{\i0}{Gord+PJ}
Dialogue: 50,0:08:22.98,0:08:28.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{Like I said, you can be so\Noptimistic because you didn't see - OG}{what a pain this snake can be. - OG}Like I said, you didn't see how\Npissed off this snake was.{Gord, Referencing wording from Skypiea 14}
Dialogue: 50,0:08:28.40,0:08:30.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{This good-tempered snake? - OG}This sweetheart of a snake?{\i0}{Gord+PJ}
Dialogue: 50,0:08:30.45,0:08:33.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{Hey, now listen here, Usopp! - OG}Alright, come on, Usopp!{Gord+Polly}
Dialogue: 50,0:08:33.66,0:08:35.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{This good-tempered snake? - OG}This sweetheart of a snake?{\i0}{Gord+PJ}
Dialogue: 50,0:08:35.75,0:08:37.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{It was a Tone Dial! - OG}It was a tone dial!{Z}
Dialogue: 50,0:08:37.08,0:08:39.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{Don't do stupid stuff like that! - OG}Enough with the stupid gag!{Gord+Polly}
Dialogue: 50,0:08:40.04,0:08:44.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0, 1150)}Yeah, it's stupid! It's really stupid!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:44.38,0:08:47.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What the heck?!\NWhat does this snake eat?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:47.55,0:08:49.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Are we there yet, Luffy?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:49.01,0:08:50.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{Look! There they are! - OG}Look! There it is!{Gord}
Dialogue: 50,0:08:50.76,0:08:52.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wow! Amazing!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:52.55,0:08:54.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This is the real thing!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:54.56,0:08:57.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{It's pretty! It looks just like the ones\Nthat we saw at the monkeys' house! - OG}So pretty! Just like the ones\Nwe saw at the monkeys' house!{Gord+Naoto, CPS}
Dialogue: 50,0:08:59.56,0:09:01.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,See? See? See?!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:01.81,0:09:02.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{There's all this! - OG}Look at all this!{Gord+Polly}
Dialogue: 50,0:09:03.61,0:09:06.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Isn't it awesome?!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:14.74,0:09:16.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{So this is gold... - OG}So this is the golden...{PP}
Dialogue: 50,0:09:18.00,0:09:19.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,– How beautiful...\N– Incredible...
Dialogue: 50,0:09:19.62,0:09:22.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,– I didn't expect it to be this...\N– How magnificent.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:22.75,0:09:25.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{But one of the side\Ncolumns has been broken. - OG}But one of the side\Ncolumns is broken.{PP}
Dialogue: 50,0:09:25.96,0:09:28.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{Yeah, but there isn't much we can do. - OG}Yeah, it's been through a lot.{Gord}
Dialogue: 50,0:09:28.05,0:09:30.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{Hey! Look at that. - OG}Hey! Look there.{Gord}
Dialogue: 50,0:09:31.43,0:09:34.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So this is... the poneglyph...
Dialogue: 50,0:09:35.01,0:09:39.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{The stone that our ancestors\Nrisked the city's life to protect...! - OG}The stone that our ancestors\Nrisked the city to protect!{Z+Spicy}
Dialogue: 50,0:09:40.77,0:09:43.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{Just what is written on it, Chief? - OG}So what's written on it, Chief?{Gord}
Dialogue: 50,0:09:45.23,0:09:47.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{Something we're better\Noff not knowing... - OG}It isn't for us to know...{PP, Viz}
Dialogue: 50,0:09:51.28,0:09:52.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We just...
Dialogue: 50,0:09:52.45,0:09:55.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{"Hold our true motive in your\Nhearts and speak not of it. - OG}"Hold the truth in your heart,\Nand speak not of it.{Gord, Skypiea 12 26:55}
Dialogue: 50,0:09:56.58,0:09:59.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We are the ones who weave history...
Dialogue: 50,0:09:59.62,0:10:01.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{with the sounding of\Nthe grand belfry..." - OG}with the sounding of the grand bell..."{Gord, Skypiea 12 27:01}
Dialogue: 50,0:10:03.67,0:10:06.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,How do you know those words?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:06.38,0:10:09.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They were carved on\Nthe Shandian ruins.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:09.38,0:10:13.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{So you were the keepers,\Nentrusted with this for generations. - OG}{So you were the guardians,\Nentrusted with this for generations. - Gord, Viz}So you were the guardians who\Nprotected this for generations.{Polly}
Dialogue: 50,0:10:19.60,0:10:23.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{Could it be... You can\Nread those characters?! - OG}Could it be... You can\Nread those symbols?!{Gord, we seem to favor "symbols" in earlier eps}
Dialogue: 50,0:10:28.15,0:10:32.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{Poseidon, the "ancient\Nweapon" named after a God... - OG}Poseidon, the ancient weapon\Nnamed after a god...{Gord+Z}
Dialogue: 50,0:10:32.03,0:10:33.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{Its whereabouts... - OG}Its location...{Gord, Viz}
Dialogue: 50,0:10:33.57,0:10:34.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What?! What's that?!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:34.86,0:10:35.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{She said "ancient"! - OG}"Ancient"?!{Gord+Polly, CPS}
Dialogue: 50,0:10:35.49,0:10:37.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ancient weapon?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:37.28,0:10:39.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{Why is it talking about\Nsomething like that?! - OG}Why would they write\Nsomething like that?!{Gord+Z}
Dialogue: 50,0:10:39.70,0:10:41.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 50,0:10:41.75,0:10:46.58,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,Another weapon... {separate from Pluton that\NI read about in Arabasta... - OG}different from\Nthe Pluton I read about in Alabasta...{Z}
Dialogue: 50,0:10:47.29,0:10:49.21,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,{To think that there are\Nsuch dangerous things - OG}To think that such dangerous things{Gord, CPS, Viz}
Dialogue: 50,0:10:49.21,0:10:52.59,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,{in this world waiting to be found...! - OG}still slumber somewhere\Nin the world...!{Gord+PP}
Dialogue: 50,0:10:53.80,0:10:55.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{Just as I thought, this\Nwas a disappointment. - OG}I should've known better.{WF}
Dialogue: 50,0:10:56.05,0:10:59.35,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,{This isn't what I want to know. - OG}This isn't what I've been searching for.{Gord}
Dialogue: 50,0:10:59.35,0:11:00.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{Hey! - OG}Hey, you!{PP}
Dialogue: 50,0:11:00.81,0:11:03.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{Aren't those the same\Nkind of characters - OG}{on that engraving next to it?! - OG}Aren't there more of those symbols\Nengraved next to it?!{Gord+Polly+Z+Spicy, CPS}
Dialogue: 50,0:11:04.14,0:11:05.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:08.86,0:11:12.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,"Gol D. Roger"...!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:13.74,0:11:15.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{What?! - OG}What is this?!{Polly}
Dialogue: 50,0:11:16.61,0:11:19.45,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,I made it here.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:19.45,0:11:22.66,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,{I will guide this text to\Nthe ends of the earth. - OG}I will guide this text to\Nthe ends of the world.{Gord, Wano 37 35:55}
Dialogue: 50,0:11:22.66,0:11:25.41,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Pirate Gol D. Roger.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:27.63,0:11:28.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{King of the Pirates...! - OG}The King of the Pirates...!{WF}
Dialogue: 50,0:11:29.38,0:11:33.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Could this mean that he came\Nto this sky island, too?!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:34.05,0:11:39.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{No, more importantly, why\Ncan he use these characters? - OG}No, more importantly,\Nhow did he know this script?{Gord+Polly}
Dialogue: 50,0:11:41.85,0:11:43.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{So it says Roger? - OG}Did I hear "Roger"?{So it mentions Roger? - Polly}
Dialogue: 50,0:11:44.52,0:11:45.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You know him?!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:45.73,0:11:51.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{He's a Blue Sea pirate who came to\Nthis sky more than 20 years ago. - OG}He's a Blue Sea pirate who came to\Nthis sky over twenty years ago.{Z}
Dialogue: 50,0:11:51.61,0:11:53.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So his name is engraved there?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:53.78,0:11:54.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:55.15,0:11:59.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{I don't know how he reached this bell, - OG}I don't know how\Nhe reached this bell...{Z}
Dialogue: 50,0:11:59.99,0:12:02.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{but this sure is indelible\Nproof that he did. - OG}but this is definitive proof that he did.{Spicy+Gord}
Dialogue: 50,0:12:03.45,0:12:08.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{Come to think of it, there're\Ntwo kinds of Poneglyph stones. - OG}Come to think of it, there are\Ntwo kinds of poneglyph stones.{Gord+Z}
Dialogue: 50,0:12:08.92,0:12:13.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{Ones with information, and others\Nthat indicate their whereabouts. - OG}Ones with information,\Nand others that mark locations.{Gord+Polly}
Dialogue: 50,0:12:13.50,0:12:16.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{And this stone is one of\Nthe ones with information. - OG}This is the type with information.{Z}
Dialogue: 50,0:12:22.97,0:12:25.35,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,"I made it here.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:25.98,0:12:28.48,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,{I will guide this\Ntext to the ends of the earth." - OG}I will guide this text to\Nthe ends of the world."{Gord, Wano 37 35:55}
Dialogue: 50,0:12:30.35,0:12:31.94,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,Guide this text...
Dialogue: 50,0:12:33.52,0:12:34.78,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,Guide...
Dialogue: 50,0:12:39.32,0:12:40.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{It couldn't be...! - OG}Could it be...?!{Naoto}
Dialogue: 50,0:12:40.49,0:12:42.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Could the Rio Poneglyph be...?!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:48.08,0:12:48.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Chief...
Dialogue: 50,0:12:49.67,0:12:53.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This poneglyph has\Nalready fulfilled its role!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:53.67,0:12:55.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It has?!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:56.84,0:12:57.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{That's right. - OG}Yes.{Gord}
Dialogue: 50,0:12:57.72,0:13:02.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{I bet those Poneglyphs\Nwith information - OG}{scattered around the world - OG}I believe the informational poneglyphs\Nscattered around the world{Gord+Polly, CPS}
Dialogue: 50,0:13:02.26,0:13:08.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{will, when put together,\Nbecome one text - OG}{that will fill the "Blank\NHistory" for the first time. - OG}can be combined into a single text\Nthat will fill in the Void Century.{Gord}
Dialogue: 50,0:13:09.98,0:13:14.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{In other words, the text\Ncompleted by connecting them... - OG}In other words, connecting\Nthe full text creates...{Gord+PP}
Dialogue: 50,0:13:14.23,0:13:19.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{That is the Rio Poneglyph,\Nwhich still does not exist. - OG}something never seen before:\Nthe Rio Poneglyph.{Gord}
Dialogue: 50,0:13:20.36,0:13:22.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Gol D. Roger, King of the Pirates,
Dialogue: 50,0:13:23.16,0:13:26.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{definitely delivered this\Ntext to its destination. - OG}must have delivered this\Ntext to its destination.{Naoto}
Dialogue: 50,0:13:33.63,0:13:34.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So it's no longer...
Dialogue: 50,0:13:34.50,0:13:35.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Then...
Dialogue: 50,0:13:35.50,0:13:36.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:38.09,0:13:43.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We... don't have to...\Nfight any longer?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:46.10,0:13:50.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{I see... Our ancestors' wish\Nhas been fulfilled, then? - OG}I see... So the wish of\Nour ancestors has been fulfilled?{Gord}
Dialogue: 50,0:13:52.02,0:13:53.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,– Chief!\N– Chief!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:53.06,0:13:54.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Are you all right?!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:54.61,0:13:59.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Good... Good... So our\Nduty has been fulfilled!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:01.03,0:14:02.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:03.11,0:14:04.95,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,Which means I, too,
Dialogue: 50,0:14:04.95,0:14:09.50,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,{have to guide the text on those\NPoneglyphs that I read in the past... - OG}have to guide the text on\Nthe poneglyphs I've read...{Gord+Z}
Dialogue: 50,0:14:10.66,0:14:14.00,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,{to the end of the Grand\NLine... to Laugh Tale... - OG}to the end of the\NGrand Line... to Laugh Tale...{Gord}
Dialogue: 50,0:14:16.25,0:14:24.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{Young lady, the feeling that straw hat\Nkid gives me is reminiscent of Roger. - OG}Young lady, that straw hat boy gives\Nme the same feeling Roger once did.{Polly}
Dialogue: 50,0:14:25.05,0:14:27.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{Is it my imagination? - OG}But perhaps it's just my imagination.{Gord+Polly}
Dialogue: 50,0:14:27.68,0:14:30.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,His name is Monkey D. Luffy.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:30.06,0:14:32.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{My interest in him never fades. - OG}He never fails to keep my interest.{Polly}
Dialogue: 50,0:14:32.52,0:14:36.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{D? I see. He's got the\Nsame letter in his name. - OG}D? I see. So they share\Nthat letter in their names.{Polly+Gord}
Dialogue: 50,0:14:39.44,0:14:44.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{Yes... and I'm sure it's a big issue\Nthat has something to do with history. - OG}Yes... and I'm sure it's quite\Nimportant to our history.{Gord}
Dialogue: 50,0:14:45.66,0:14:46.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{By the way, young lady... - OG}By the way, miss...{Gord, CPS, Viz uses and was thinking something different than }
Dialogue: 50,0:14:47.53,0:14:50.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{You guys wanted gold, right? - OG}You all wanted gold, right?{Gord}
Dialogue: 50,0:14:50.37,0:14:53.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{You said it's more valuable\Nthan Vearth in the Blue Sea. - OG}You said it's more valuable\Nthan vearth in the Blue Sea.{Gord}
Dialogue: 50,0:14:53.83,0:14:54.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:54.71,0:14:57.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{How about taking the\Nbroken belfry column, - OG}Since we can't give you the bell,{Gord}
Dialogue: 50,0:14:57.75,0:14:59.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{though we can't give you the bell... - OG}how about the bell column?{Gord+Z}
Dialogue: 50,0:14:59.29,0:15:01.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's a good idea!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:01.05,0:15:05.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{Naturally, we have to show our\Nappreciation to you guys somehow. - OG}We have to show our appreciation\Nto you guys somehow, you know.{Gord}
Dialogue: 50,0:15:05.05,0:15:05.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:05.97,0:15:06.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{Don't hold back! - OG}We insist!{Gord}
Dialogue: 50,0:15:06.93,0:15:09.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Are you sure?! They'll\Nbe happy to hear that!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:10.31,0:15:11.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{Yeah! - OG}Yes!{Gord}
Dialogue: 50,0:15:12.98,0:15:17.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Alright, then! Let's bring\Nthis to the Blue Sea people!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:17.15,0:15:19.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{Wrap it with cloths! It's hard to carry! - OG}Wrap it with cloth! It's hard to carry!{Gord}
Dialogue: 50,0:15:19.40,0:15:21.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{We'll give this to those\Nwho saved our land! - OG}Let's give it to the people\Nwho saved our land!{Polly+Z}
Dialogue: 50,0:15:21.78,0:15:23.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Man, this thing's huge...
Dialogue: 50,0:15:30.78,0:15:35.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What's Robin doing? She's late!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:35.87,0:15:37.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{Darn! I'm hungry! - OG}Oh, man! I'm hungry!{Gord+Z}
Dialogue: 50,0:15:39.38,0:15:43.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{In any case, this place is so empty. What's going on? - OG}This place sure emptied out.\NWhat's going on?{Gord+WF, Viz}
Dialogue: 50,0:15:43.67,0:15:47.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{Where the heck did the\Nguerrillas and angels go? - OG}Where did all those\Nguerrillas and angels go?{Gord}
Dialogue: 50,0:15:47.22,0:15:51.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{Well, it's better they aren't here. If\Nthey find us, they'll chase us around! - OG}Well, it's better they aren't here.\NThey'll chase us if they find out!{Gord}
Dialogue: 50,0:15:51.89,0:15:56.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{Since we're trying to steal\Nthis much gold and run, - OG}We're about to steal\Nall this gold and make a run for it.{Gord+Z+Polly}
Dialogue: 50,0:15:56.27,0:15:57.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{they won't just let us go! - OG}They won't just let us escape!{Gord}
Dialogue: 50,0:15:57.90,0:16:01.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{Well, Nami and Conis are preparing\Nto set sail, but we still have to hurry. - OG}Nami and Conis are preparing\Nthe ship, but we still have to hurry.{Gord+Polly}
Dialogue: 50,0:16:01.69,0:16:04.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{Before that, Sanji, do you\Nhave something to eat? - OG}Before that, Sanji, do we\Nhave something to eat?{Gord}
Dialogue: 50,0:16:04.28,0:16:05.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{Not until we get to the ship. - OG}Yeah, on the ship.{Spicy+Gord, CPS}
Dialogue: 50,0:16:06.28,0:16:09.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{But you've gotta have\Nsomething to munch on, right? - OG}But you've gotta have\Na little snack to munch on, right?{PP}
Dialogue: 50,0:16:09.20,0:16:10.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{[/an8]Give me some! - OG}Gimme!{Polly}
Dialogue: 50,0:16:10.53,0:16:12.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{[/an8]I can't give you what I\Ndon't have! Just give up! - OG}I can't give you what\NI don't have! Let it go!{Gord}
Dialogue: 50,0:16:09.20,0:16:10.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}What a pain!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:10.53,0:16:12.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{We don't have to wait\Nfor that woman, do we? - OG}We don't have to wait\Nfor that lady, do we?{Polly}
Dialogue: 50,0:16:12.87,0:16:14.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}I'm gonna go on ahead\Nand get on board.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:14.87,0:16:16.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Idiot! Don't!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:16.25,0:16:17.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Idiot!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:17.00,0:16:18.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{Moss Head Idiot! - OG}Idiot Moss Head!{Polly}
Dialogue: 50,0:16:18.08,0:16:19.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{Idiot Moss Head! - OG}Moss Head idiot!{Polly+Z}
Dialogue: 50,0:16:20.63,0:16:24.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{If you go into the forest alone, you won't make it three steps without getting lost! - Wtf - Villager}You won't make it three steps alone\Nin that forest without getting lost!{Gord, CPS}
Dialogue: 50,0:16:28.43,0:16:29.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, look! It's Robin!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:31.51,0:16:33.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Robin{-chan}!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:34.26,0:16:36.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{Yoo-hoo, Robin! - OG}Hey, Robin!{Gord}
Dialogue: 50,0:16:36.85,0:16:40.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{Hurry! Hurry up! We've gotta\Nrun! We stole some gold! - OG}Hurry, hurry! Make a run for it!\NWe stole some gold!{Z}
Dialogue: 50,0:16:40.60,0:16:42.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{Idiot! Don't say that! - OG}Zip it, moron!{WF}
Dialogue: 50,0:16:42.11,0:16:43.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{Take a good look behind her! - OG}Try looking behind her!{Gord}
Dialogue: 50,0:16:43.94,0:16:46.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{They're all coming back here together! - OG}They're all coming back at once!{Z}
Dialogue: 50,0:16:47.57,0:16:48.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{There's tons of them! - OG}There's a ton of them!{Z}
Dialogue: 50,0:16:51.74,0:16:56.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This is bad! This is bad!\NThis is super bad!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:56.58,0:16:58.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And what's that? A huge cannon?!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:59.41,0:17:00.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{That's gotta be it! - OG}It's gotta be!{Gord, CPS}
Dialogue: 50,0:17:00.58,0:17:03.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{They all came back all at once! - OG}They came back all at once!{Gord}
Dialogue: 50,0:17:03.79,0:17:05.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hurry to the ship!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:05.88,0:17:08.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{We can no longer stay here! - OG}We can't stay here anymore!{Z}
Dialogue: 50,0:17:09.72,0:17:11.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{Check this out! We got a good catch! - OG}Check this out! We got a good haul!{Gord}
Dialogue: 50,0:17:11.64,0:17:13.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The bag's stuffed! We're rich!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:13.97,0:17:17.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{Hm? They all have bags on their back! - OG}What? They all have their bags on!{Gord}
Dialogue: 50,0:17:17.39,0:17:20.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{Don't tell me... Are\Nthey already leaving?! - OG}Don't tell me... they're\Nleaving already?!{Gord}
Dialogue: 50,0:17:20.44,0:17:22.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, stop, you guys! Stop!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:23.19,0:17:25.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{See?! They found us out! - OG}See?! They caught us!{Gord}
Dialogue: 50,0:17:22.85,0:17:26.48,Secondary-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Hey! Stop! Stop, you guys!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:25.07,0:17:26.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Run!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:27.73,0:17:30.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{I'll strike a pose and say it! - OG}Time to strike a pose\Nand make a speech!{WF}
Dialogue: 50,0:17:31.66,0:17:34.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{You guys say, "Stop! Stop!" but... - OG}You can ask us to stop all you want!{WF}
Dialogue: 50,0:17:34.70,0:17:36.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah! Tell them, Usopp!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:38.29,0:17:41.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We risked our lives to come\Nall the way to this sky island!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:40.79,0:17:42.50,Secondary-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}That's right!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:41.29,0:17:44.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{And we've found the\Nlegendary city of gold! - OG}And we've found the\Nlegendary City of Gold!{PJ}
Dialogue: 50,0:17:43.04,0:17:46.09,Secondary-207-,,0,0,0,,{[/an8]Robin-chan! Hurry up! We'll be caught! - OG}{\an8}Robin! Hurry up! We'll get caught!{Naoto}
Dialogue: 50,0:17:44.04,0:17:49.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{How the heck can we, proud pirates,\Njust go back empty-handed?! - OG}Would you really expect proud pirates\Nlike us to go back empty-handed?!{Gord}
Dialogue: 50,0:17:49.59,0:17:51.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What?! Caught?!\NWhat's he talking about?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:52.34,0:17:54.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,All we want to do is thank them!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:54.47,0:17:58.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey miss, aren't you guys\Ngonna take this gold?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:01.89,0:18:02.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{Looks like they don't need it! - OG}I guess not!{Gord, CPS}
Dialogue: 50,0:18:02.85,0:18:04.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,– What?!\N– What?!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:04.73,0:18:06.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:09.65,0:18:11.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Run!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:10.53,0:18:14.07,Secondary-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}– Hey! Wait!\N– Hey! Wait!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:14.07,0:18:17.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{They're all after us! It's scary! - OG}They're all after us! Too scary!{Polly}
Dialogue: 50,0:18:18.29,0:18:20.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,How was that?! Wasn't I cool?!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:20.45,0:18:22.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah! Well done!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:23.62,0:18:26.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{Robin-chan! Hurry! - OG}Robin my love! Hurry!{Z}
Dialogue: 50,0:18:26.63,0:18:29.76,Secondary-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}– Hey! Come back!\N– Hey! Come back!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:29.76,0:18:31.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Guys!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:31.42,0:18:35.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Keep running all the way\Nto the end of the sky!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:35.34,0:18:39.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,– Yeah!\N– Yeah!
