Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.33,0:00:20.54,Luffy Monologue,,0,0,0,,{Did you know that there's an awesome\Ntreasure at the end of this sea?! - OG}Did you know there's an awesome\Ntreasure at the end of this sea?!{Gab}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.54,0:00:23.34,Luffy Monologue,,0,0,0,,{And whoever gets it\Ncan be king of the pirates! - OG}And whoever gets it\Nbecomes King of the Pirates!{Gab}
