Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.75,0:18:48.27,TranslationED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur5}When you're lost and alone, \Ncall out and lead me to your side
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.49,0:18:53.69,TranslationED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur5}As you wander far from home, \Nyou search the sky and never hide
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.69,0:18:56.49,TranslationED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur5}You are so much like the moon
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.49,0:19:01.14,TranslationED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur5}Calmer than a star, your twinkling's lost
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.59,0:19:13.54,TranslationED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur5}A deep reflection shines, you slowly leave, \Nfading, and what's the cost?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.60,0:19:18.77,TranslationED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur5}Stay as you are, don't lose your way
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.77,0:19:27.08,TranslationED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur5}Let my words guide you, \Nand look ahead until the day!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.72,0:19:33.97,TranslationED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur5}Don't give up on your dreams, \Nthrough endless nights they come to you
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.97,0:19:39.59,TranslationED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur5}If you stop, you'll never see them shining through!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.83,0:19:45.36,TranslationED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur5}Will you return? Maybe not... \NWill you learn? I hope you do
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.36,0:19:51.75,TranslationED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur5}Please put your past to rest, \Nand live your life anew.
